# rest.nvim 演示文件
# 用法（在 nvim 中打开本文件）：
#   1. 把光标放在某个请求上（方法名那一行即可）
#   2. <leader>Rr  或  :Rest run     — 运行光标处请求
#   3. <leader>Ro  或  :Rest open    — 打开/聚焦结果窗
#   4. <leader>Rl  或  :Rest last    — 重跑上一次
# 多个请求之间用 ### 分隔。

### Get a sample JSON todo
# @name get_todo
GET https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/todos/1
Accept: application/json

### GitHub zen quote (plain text)
# @name github_zen
GET https://api.github.com/zen
User-Agent: rest.nvim-demo

### Echo query params
# @name echo_get
GET https://postman-echo.com/get?from=nvim&tool=rest.nvim
Accept: application/json

### POST JSON body
# @name create_post
POST https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/posts
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "rest.nvim demo",
  "body": "Hello from Neovim",
  "userId": 1
}

### POST form-style to echo service
# @name echo_post
POST https://postman-echo.com/post
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "if you see this in json, the request worked",
  "editor": "nvim"
}
